# Heard — UI/UX Redesign Spec ("The Listening Room")

The 2026 redesign. Every surface is rebuilt to this spec. **The brand palette and
the logo are untouchable** — all color tokens in `app/globals.css` keep their
exact values, and `components/shared/Logo.tsx` is not modified. Everything else
(layout, type scale, components, section design, motion) is rebuilt.

Quality bar: teww.org — editorial, confident, warm. Not a template.

## 1. Concept

**Sound made visible.** The logo's concentric listening arcs are the one
recurring graphic motif across the app:

- `ArcField` — a decorative SVG of thin concentric arcs (teal at low opacity,
  one amber stroke) used as hero/section backdrop, bleeding off an edge.
- Avatar availability ring — an arc segment around the avatar when a listener
  is available now.
- The voice player's waveform — amber bars, the signature interactive moment.
- Empty states — small arc mark + one serif sentence.

Never more than one arc treatment per viewport. It's a whisper, not wallpaper.

## 2. Tokens (globals.css)

Colors: **unchanged, byte for byte.** The redesign uses the existing palette
plus two existing colors in new roles: `--color-ink` as a full-bleed band
background (footer, call stage) with cream/white text, and `--color-primary`
as a full-bleed band background (stats, availability). No new hues.

Type scale grows a display end (all clamp-based, body floor stays 18px):

```
--text-display: clamp(2.875rem, 2rem + 3vw, 4.25rem);   /* 46 → 68px */
--text-h1:      clamp(2.125rem, 1.75rem + 1.6vw, 2.875rem);
--text-kicker:  0.8125rem;  /* 13px small caps, +0.14em tracking, weight 800 */
```

New knobs: `--radius-tile: 20px`, `--shadow-lift` (hover), `--ease-warm`
(kept). Numerals in data contexts always `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`.

Fonts stay Lora (display) + Nunito Sans (body) — the wordmark is set in Lora;
changing display type would orphan the logo.

## 3. Voice & type rules

- Kicker (small caps sans, tracked, teal or `--color-accent-strong`) above
  section headings. Sentence case everywhere; no Title Case.
- Display/h1/h2 in Lora with `-0.015em` tracking and `text-wrap: balance`.
- Oversized serif numerals (01/02/03, stats) are a display element: Lora,
  tabular, sometimes 96px+, always paired with a small sans caption.
- Body ≤ 65ch. `text-wrap: pretty` on paragraphs.

## 4. Surfaces & depth

- Default surface is **flat on cream** — no border, no shadow. Separation via
  spacing and hairlines (`--color-border`).
- White cards keep **only** where elevation means something: listener cards,
  dialogs, form panels, incoming-request rows. Radius 20px, `--shadow-sm`,
  **no border**. Hover (interactive only): lift to `--shadow-lift` +
  `-translate-y-0.5`.
- Tonal bands for rhythm: teal band (stats, availability strip), ink band
  (footer, call stage), `--color-surface-sunk` wells (recessed lists).
- Tables: no card box. Hairline rows, kicker-style column headers, 16px+ row
  padding. Status = dot + tinted chip, never color alone.

## 5. Components (components/ui)

| Component | Redesign |
|---|---|
| Button | Pill (`--radius-pill`), weight 800, ≥48px. Press: `scale(0.98)`. Primary teal; amber only for the one warm CTA per page; ghost = transparent + hairline; quiet = underline link. Focus ring rule unchanged. |
| VoicePlayer | Signature component, bigger: 56px round teal play button, 24-bar amber waveform (animates only while playing), serif tabular duration. On cream, no box. |
| Avatar | Rounded-square (radius 28%), warm tint fills per-person, serif initial. Availability = arc ring segment + dot chip, with text label nearby. |
| StatTile | No box: big serif tabular numeral + kicker caption, optional thin amber underline spark. Bands/rows only, hairline-separated. |
| Chip/Tag | Tint fill (`primary-tint`/`accent-tint`), no border, sentence case, AA text (`accent-strong` on amber tint). |
| StatusBadge | Dot + label on tint. Approved=success, pending=amber (text `accent-strong`), suspended/rejected=alert. |
| Field/Select | 52px min height, white fill, `border-strong` 1.5px, focus = `--color-focus` ring; label weight 700 + required text; error = alert text + icon under field. |
| Dialog | Radius 24, warm ink backdrop at 45% opacity, no border, close button ≥48px. |
| Toast | Ink bg, cream text, bottom-center, radius pill. |
| DataTable | As §4. Sortable headers keep buttons + aria-sort. |
| Section/Container | Container unchanged (85% / 1500px). Section gains tones: `page`, `surface`, `band` (teal), `ink`. py-24 desktop / py-14 mobile. |
| Reveal | Keep, tune: 16px rise, 500ms, `--ease-warm`, fires once, honors reduced motion (global rule already kills animation). Stagger via delay on grids. |

Shared chrome:

- **AppHeader**: cream bg, hairline bottom, 72px tall. Active nav item = teal
  text + 2px teal underline offset under the link (aria-current="page").
  Signed-in: role nav + avatar + quiet sign-out.
- **MarketingFooter** (new, marketing layout only): ink band, `Logo
  tone="onPrimary"`, three short link groups (Product / For listeners /
  Safety), safety line, small print. No link farm.
- **SafetyBanner**: keep exact copy + report affordance; restyle to a compact
  strip on `surface-sunk` with success-strong shield icon.

## 6. Pages

**Home** — sections in order, alternating tones (cream → teal → cream → white
→ cream → split → ink footer):
1. Hero (cream): kicker "Companionship by voice", display headline, one-line
   sub, primary CTA + quiet sign-in link, trust line. ArcField bleeding from
   the right edge behind, low opacity. No screenshot, no card.
2. Stats band (teal): three oversized cream serif numerals + captions,
   hairline-separated, staggered baselines. (Existing en.json stat values.)
3. How it works (cream): three numbered editorial rows (01 listen to a voice /
   02 pick your minutes / 03 just talk) — oversized pale-teal numerals left,
   serif title + one sans sentence, hairlines between. Not cards.
4. Voices (white): 3 listener-style preview cards with VoicePlayer strips
   (static marketing copy, no DB) — the "hear a voice first" product truth.
5. Quote (cream): one big serif italic pull-quote, giant pale-amber quotation
   mark, off-grid left, arc whisper right. Static testimonial from en.json.
6. Become-a-listener (split): left teal block, serif headline "Your voice is
   your work." + amber CTA; right: gallery image `provider-dashboard.png` in
   BrowserFrame, or warm tint block on mobile.
7. Footer (ink).

**Auth** — split panel kept but elevated: teal panel with `Logo
tone="onPrimary"`, one giant serif statement, three checklist lines, ArcField
whisper bottom; form panel white, fields per §5, single primary button.

**Browse** — serif page title + count + one-line help; filter chips row
(language/price/availability as tinted toggle chips ≥48px). Grid `repeat(3,
minmax(0,1fr))` on xl / 2 / 1. Listener card: avatar + availability arc,
serif name + rating (star icon + tabular number), VoicePlayer strip, topic
chips (max 3), hairline, price left (serif tabular) + "View profile" primary
button right, pinned bottom.

**Listener profile** — editorial header (large avatar, display serif name,
rating + availability + favorite on one row), VoicePlayer centerpiece with
transcript block underneath, then flat hairline sections: topics, languages,
pricing (three flat duration options as tiles: serif price + minutes), "What
people say" review rows (stars, quote, tip chip). Booking CTA sticky on
desktop right column; stacked on mobile.

**Booking** — single column, max-w-2xl: listener recap row, duration as three
big radio tiles (price serif, minutes caption, selected = teal fill), notes
field, total row (hairline, serif tabular), primary confirm. Keep all
form/action wiring.

**Account** — flat hairline groups: upcoming bookings (list rows + join
buttons), past sessions table, favorites row of mini cards, settings link
rows. No card boxes.

**Session/call stage** — immersive ink band full-height: breathing concentric
arcs behind a big serif timer (tabular), listener name + avatar, oversized
controls (end = alert, mute = ghost-on-ink), all ≥48px with labels. Rate/tip
after-screen: warm cream, star buttons ≥48px, tip chips, one textarea.

**Provider dashboard** — display serif greeting; availability as a full-width
band (teal fill when available, sunk well when offline) with the toggle and
next-session line; "At a glance" as flat StatTile row with hairlines;
incoming requests as elevated white rows with Accept (primary) / Decline
(ghost); recent sessions + payout history as §4 tables; feedback as quote
rows; profile health as compact two-column checklist rows with success dots.

**Provider onboarding** — numbered serif stepper (01–04) left/top, one panel
per step, VoiceIntroRecorder gets the big-play treatment.

**Admin** — overview: three labeled groups (kicker headings "Strategic",
"Operational", "Needs attention") of flat StatTiles in hairline grid — no 14
white boxes. Non-zero "needs attention" numerals get alert color + link.
Approvals: white rows with avatar, VoicePlayer inline, Approve
(primary)/Reject (ghost) + reason dialog. Users/reports/activity: §4 tables.
Payouts: StatTile row + run button + result toast.

**404 / error** — arc mark, serif statement, one primary path home. Keep
copy keys.

## 7. Motion

200–300ms, `--ease-warm`, transform/opacity only. Reveal on section entries
(once, staggered ≤ 80ms steps). Button press scale. Waveform animates only
while playing. Call-stage arcs breathe at 4s. Everything obeys the existing
global reduced-motion kill switch.

## 8. Hard constraints (unchanged from CLAUDE.md)

WCAG 2.2 AA min / AAA body contrast; keyboard operability; visible focus
(global rule); semantic HTML; labeled controls; no state by color alone;
≥48px targets; axe tests must pass. All copy via `messages/en.json` (new keys
namespaced under the surface that owns them; never reformat the whole file).
Server components by default. No new dependencies. `lucide-react` stays the
icon set (stroke 2, size 20/24) — consistency over novelty.

## 9. Contrast cheat-sheet (pre-verified)

- ink on bg/surface: AAA ✓ (12.4:1)
- primary on surface (buttons: white text on #136F63): 5.9:1 AA ✓
- cream #FBF7F2 text on teal #136F63 band: 5.6:1 AA ✓ (use ≥18px or bold)
- white on ink #2A2622: 13.6:1 AAA ✓
- amber #E08A3C: **decorative only** — never text on light; text on
  accent-tint uses `--color-accent-strong` ✓
- ink-soft on bg: 4.9:1 AA ✓; ink-faint: placeholders/disabled only
